            ],
            "conclusion": "For any `A ≥ 0` with `EuclideanAsymptotic F A` and any `TraceSpectrum F μ`, `Zlog r • ∫ φ(r⁻¹ p) dμ → (A/(1536π)) • ∫_cone m(p)^2 φ` for continuous compactly supported φ, `Zlog r = r^-8 log^2 r`."
